ive flair! From the floors and walls to the furniture and decor, everything can be customised!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there is a <strong>lot</strong> to customise, with over 200 unique items to be discovered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/4b071b4c7fbd9ad7780849e4b53ed8ea.avif?t=1781869558\" width=657 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/994ed2bf6a2acc3a8924448733aa14cb.poster.avif?t=1781869558\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/994ed2bf6a2acc3a8924448733aa14cb.webm?t=1781869558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/994ed2bf6a2acc3a8924448733aa14cb.mp4?t=1781869558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Café getting a little TOO popular? Thing’s getting too cosy and not enough tables to deal with the ever growing line of cats?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe it’s time to hit up <i><strong>Claw Hammer Construction</strong></i> to upgrade the your kitchen and café floor space, unlock upgrades and features, and purchase new materials to decorate with!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/4919aff79095f91560e7b27116680d19.avif?t=1781869558\" width=657 height=134 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st