10239a975406e4739fef410fe7a5c6.avif?t=1781869558\" width=657 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t forget to pay your rent and bills or you might have to take out loans (boo!) to keep the landlord at bay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of everything using calendars and graphs and stuff, its all very boring and fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Potentially go bankrupt due to being bad at capitalism (<i>see next section</i>)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/34ab4eeea419de1f3124b0925cb1c7a5.avif?t=1781869558\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor the game to what YOU want! Want the vanilla business management mixed with collecting and decoration? Awesome! Wanna turn off all the rent and bills and just collect stuff and make a cool space? We got you too!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neko Café wants to be as open to expression and creativity as possible, and that means making our game as accessible for you as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and befriend the Catizens of New Neko City!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock over 60 sandwich ingredients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find over 200 unique items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purrsonalise everything from the floors to uniforms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire, train, and promote your staff to greatness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play dress ups and boop noses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility options incl fully remappable controls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103110/extras/c00c4de